WEBVTT

00:10:57.746 --> 00:11:00.079
and from my own wild terrain of grief

00:11:00.121 --> 00:11:04.162
is if I pay close enough attention,

00:11:04.204 --> 00:11:07.746
I don't need to see emotion
in color after all.

00:11:07.787 --> 00:11:10.871
It's there and it's visible
in the details.

00:11:10.912 --> 00:11:15.621
In the way our communities love each other
through anything and everything.

00:11:16.621 --> 00:11:18.621
And with my camera,

00:11:18.662 --> 00:11:22.079
I can capture the evidence
of that forever,

00:11:22.121 --> 00:11:24.037
and I can give it back to them to keep.

00:11:26.329 --> 00:11:28.912
Right now, my cancer is stable.

00:11:29.954 --> 00:11:33.746
I am so glad that for now,